# Development Ledger

Status: IN_PROGRESS
Milestone: Entire project lifecycle
Dependencies: None

## Purpose

Maintain a book-ready chronological record of every instruction, developer action, verified result,
correction, decision, and screenshot.

## Tasks

- [x] Create ignored `docs/ledger/` location.
- [x] Define chapter format.
- [x] Define screenshot storage and citation policy.
- [x] Document Unity project creation and URP activation.
- [ ] Append every future meaningful instruction and completed action.
- [ ] Copy every accessible chat screenshot into `docs/ledger/media/`.
- [ ] Reference screenshots from the correct chapter.
- [ ] Keep facts grounded in repository evidence or explicit user reports.
- [ ] Periodically reconcile chapter order and book structure.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] `docs/ledger/` is ignored by Git.
- [x] Ledger has a book index and first chronological chapter.
- [x] First chapter distinguishes guidance, developer action, repository evidence, and visual confirmation.
- [x] Screenshot policy prohibits invented descriptions.
- [ ] Ledger remains current throughout development.

